# PyMuPDF Licensing Gate

StrataForge Phase 01 uses `PyMuPDF` for deterministic text extraction, outline extraction support,
page rendering, and OCR orchestration.

## Release posture

- PyMuPDF is dual-licensed under AGPL or a commercial Artifex license.
- This repository does not assume AGPL compliance as the default production posture.
- Production release approval is gated on commercial-license review and approval.

## Engineering implication

- Phase 01 can be technically complete and fully validated while release readiness remains blocked on
  licensing clearance.
- If the licensing decision changes, update this note and the Phase 01 ADR instead of silently
  changing release assumptions.
